v class="landing-feature-banner__content--neutral landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>1. Know what sells</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--neutral" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Popular Valentine’s Day products include:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Customised gifts<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->: Think of engraved items, personalised photo albums, or monogrammed accessories.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Gift bundles<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->: Create curated packages, like chocolate and wine sets or self-care hampers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Themed items<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->: Get your creative hat on to make the most of what you have. If you sell homemade cakes, why not bake a red velvet limited edition one? Or if your most popular items are available in red or pink, consider selling them as a Valentine’s bundle.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="2.-international-sales" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--white" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uG3pbqstJ9-C87_Chocolatesa942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uG3pbqstJ9-C87_Chocolates.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uG3pbqstJ9-C87_Chocolates.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uG3pbqstJ9-C87_Chocolates.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--white landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>2. International sales</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--white" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->According to Shopify, <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->20% of Valentine’s shoppers send gifts internationally<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. With Evri, you can deliver to over 200 countries and territories, from the <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/usa" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->USA<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/hong-kong" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Hong Kong<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, ensuring you reach customers and loved ones worldwide.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tip<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->: Promote your international shipping options early and highlight any key last posting dates for items to arrive on time.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="3.-make-your-campaign-stand-out" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--neutral" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_56118a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen." width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--neutral landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>3. Make your campaign stand out</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--neutral" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Use creative marketing to grab the attention of your customers:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Add a new category on your website to signpost users to your seasonal product range.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Offer discounts or free Next Day UK delivery for orders over a certain amount.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Create a sense of urgency with countdown timers on your website and social media platforms.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="4.-save-time-sending-parcels" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--white" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptopc413.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--white landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>4. Save time sending parcels</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--white" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/bulk-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Bulk Send tool<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, you can process lots of orders at once, saving you time on booking. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Simply link your Evri account with popular platforms like eBay, Amazon, Etsy and more or upload a CSV file. You can import online orders and manage your parcels in one place - we’ll even automatically update the tracking for you to keep your customers in the loop.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="terms-and-conditions" class="faqs" index="11" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Terms and Conditions</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="gotavalentinesdaydiscountcode-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-gotavalentinesdaydiscountcode" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-gotavalentinesdaydiscountcode" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Got a Valentine’s Day discount code?-open answer" data-test-id="gotavalentinesdaydiscountcode-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="gotavalentinesdaydiscountcode-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Got a Valentine’s Day discount code?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <pa