e":18,"uid":17,"link_type":19,"key":20,"isBroken":21},"ZL-1EREAACAAEkhR","subpath1",[15],"Guides","en-gb","guides","2023-07-25T12:59:36+0000","Document","cfd33c25-085a-4138-9d6b-3889d63567c8",false,{"link_type":19},[24,49,74,131,167,227,273,296,329,366,392,417],{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":27,"primary":29,"id":47,"slice_type":48,"slice_label":38},"pageHeaderNoCta","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[28],{},{"theme":30,"PageHeaderTitle":31,"PageHeaderText":32,"PageHeaderImage":33,"heroImage":45,"videoContent":46,"showPremiumLogo":21},"standard","Valentine’s Day 2026",[],{"dimensions":34,"alt":37,"copyright":38,"url":39,"id":40,"edit":41},{"width":35,"height":36},500,132,"Send a parcel",null,"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fbe2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg","YiExBxIAACgAAWmC",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":50,"version":26,"items":51,"primary":52,"id":72,"slice_type":73,"slice_label":38},"cardWithImageNoCta",[],{"CardImage":53,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":62,"CardText":63,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":54,"alt":57,"copyright":38,"url":58,"id":59,"edit":60},{"width":55,"height":56},1000,667,"Customer wrapping a gift parcel","valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VhdpbqstJ98usN_Packaginggift-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C4997%2C3333&w=1000&h=667","Z2VhdpbqstJ98usN",{"x":43,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},"none","Send love with Evri",[64,69],{"type":65,"text":66,"spans":67,"direction":68},"paragraph","Valentine’s Day isn’t just a date on the calendar; it’s an opportunity to show love, celebrate connections, and surprise someone special. Whether you’re sending Valentine’s Day flowers, chocolates, or heartfelt cards, we’re here to deliver your gifts safely and on time.",[],"ltr",{"type":65,"text":70,"spans":71,"direction":68},"For individuals and business owners alike, this celebration offers the chance to create unforgettable moments. Take a look at how to make the most of Valentine’s Day 2026 with tips, insights, and plenty of inspiration - including a section for crafters, hobbyists and businesses!",[],"card$8abbd05b-e79d-4f8b-a361-704b4a2840a3","card",{"variation":75,"version":26,"items":76,"primary":126,"id":129,"slice_type":130,"slice_label":38},"listComponent",[77,90,102,114],{"title":78,"content":79,"icon":83},"Valentine’s Day flowers",[80],{"type":65,"text":81,"spans":82,"direction":68},"Roses are timeless, but tulips, daisies, and even potted plants are gaining popularity for their longevity. Send dried flowers with us to make the occasion last!",[],{"dimensions":84,"alt":86,"copyright":38,"url":87,"id":88,"edit":89},{"width":85,"height":85},40,"Greenhouse icon","valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0a7e10ef-ea56-48e4-8c5c-f9762aa7856c_greenhouse.svg","YeWDKxEAACEAmrUk",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":91,"content":92,"icon":96},"Chocolates and sweet treats",[93],{"type":65,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":68},"Heart-shaped boxes, artisan chocolates, and indulgent gift baskets are always a hit.",[],{"dimensions":97,"alt":98,"copyright":38,"url":99,"id":100,"edit":101},{"width":85,"height":85},"Basket icon","valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F53bafab9-2901-4dcd-889e-fe8659106140_basket.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zr3",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":103,"content":104,"icon":108},"Jewellery and accessories",[105],{"type":65,"text":106,"spans":107,"direction":68},"From delicate necklaces to stylish watches, small keepsakes make big statements.",[],{"dimensions":109,"alt":110,"copyright":38,"url":111,"id":112,"edit":113},{"width":85,"height":85},"Jewellery icon","valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d232cd2-4e3c-400e-9151-18cd24f3f98b_jewellery.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-ZsK",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":115,"content":116,"icon":120},"Pamper kits",[117],{"type":65,"text":118,"spans":119,"direction":68},"Treat your loved one (or yourself!) to spa-worthy goodies like bath bombs, candles, and skincare.",[],{"dimensions":121,"alt":122,"copyright":38,"url":123,"id":124,"edit":125},{"width":85,"height":85},"Perfume bottle icon","valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fa059ef48-2b4e-41b9-b526-2b0c0d50e0b2_fragrances.svg","Yh96FxIAACgA-ZsX",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"theme":30,"title":127,"description":128},"Perfect gift ideas to send this Valentine’s","Valentine’s Day gifts come in all shapes and sizes, from large teddies to luxury jewellery. Here are some popular items that are perfect to send:","list_block$c3ae7be2-8a20-477b-8f13-cbf62ee6b7d3","list_block",{"variation":132,"version":26,"items":133,"primary":134,"id":166,"slice_type":73,"slice_label":38},"default-slice",[],{"CardImage":135,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":141,"CardText":142,"ButtonText":37,"ButtonUrl":162,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":136,"alt":38,"copyright":38,"url":138,"id":139,"edit":140},{"width":55,"height":137},666,"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5uJbZbqstJ9-C-u_Motherandson-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z5uJbZbqstJ9-C-u",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},"Not just for couples: Celebrate love in all its forms",[143,146,153,157],{"type":65,"text":144,"spans":145,"direction":68},"Valentine’s Day has grown beyond just romance, making it a celebration of every kind of love. If you’re looking to send something special, consider these themes:",[],{"type":147,"text":148,"spans":149,"direction":68},"list-item","Galentine’s Day: Celebrate friendships with thoughtful gifts like matching bracelets, wine hampers, or themed gift boxes.",[150],{"start":42,"end":151,"type":152},15,"strong",{"type":147,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":68},"Palentine’s Day: Show your appreciation for friends with quirky mugs, snacks, or fun keepsakes.",[156],{"start":42,"end":151,"type":152},{"type":147,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":68},"Self-love treats: Remind yourself (or your customers) that love starts with self-care. Think self-care bundles, pamper kits, motivational journals, or fitness gear to invest in yourself.",[160],{"start":42,"end":161,"type":152},16,{"link_type":163,"key":164,"url":165},"Web","d3e45210-4f0b-4633-822b-1d8e7c62663d","valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fevri.com\u002Fsend","card$85ee8680-4f02-42af-96bf-995464057a55",{"variation":132,"version":26,"items":168,"primary":169,"id":226,"slice_type":73,"slice_label":38},[],{"CardImage":170,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":176,"CardText":177,"ButtonText":37,"ButtonUrl":225,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":171,"alt":38,"copyright":38,"url":173,"id":174,"edit":175},{"width":55,"height":172},680,"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},"Tips to ensure Valentine’s Day gifts arrive on time",[178,184,203,208],{"type":65,"text":179,"spans":180,"direction":68},"Timing is everything when it comes to Valentine’s Day. With Evri’s Next Day delivery, you can ensure your parcel arrives just in time for the big day—even for last-minute shoppers. Here are some tips:",[181],{"start":182,"end":183,"type":152},67,84,{"type":147,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":68},"Plan ahead: For UK delivery, choose Next Day delivery drop off your before 12pm at your local ParcelShop. For international destinations, aim to send between mid-January to early February to avoid delays. Make sure to check the transit time for the country or territory you send ",[187,189,196,197,202],{"start":42,"end":188,"type":152},11,{"start":190,"end":191,"type":192,"data":193},36,53,"hyperlink",{"link_type":163,"url":194,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fnext-day-parcel-delivery","_self",{"start":190,"end":191,"type":152},{"start":198,"end":199,"type":192,"data":200},83,104,{"link_type":163,"url":201,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"start":198,"end":199,"type":152},{"type":147,"text":204,"spans":205,"direction":68},"Use tracking: Keep an eye on your parcel every step of the way. You get end-to-end tracking for you and your recipient. We'll also send updates to your recipient and a 1-hour delivery window at no extra cost",[206],{"start":42,"end":207,"type":152},14,{"type":147,"text":209,"spans":210,"direction":68},"Add parcel cover: Every parcel you send with us includes up to £20 parcel cover*. For higher-value items like jewellery, you can choose to increase your parcel cover or add a digital signature from only 60p more for extra peace of mind.  *excludes Postable parcels",[211,213,218,219,224],{"start":42,"end":212,"type":152},18,{"start":214,"end":215,"type":192,"data":216},153,165,{"link_type":163,"url":217,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fparcel-cover",{"start":214,"end":215,"type":152},{"start":220,"end":221,"type":192,"data":222},175,192,{"link_type":163,"url":223,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsignature",{"start":220,"end":221,"type":152},{"link_type":163,"key":164,"url":165},"card$9cc56746-3ad1-4526-b400-f2cccd8ba7a4",{"variation":132,"version":26,"items":228,"primary":229,"id":272,"slice_type":73,"slice_label":38},[],{"CardImage":230,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":235,"CardText":236,"ButtonText":37,"ButtonUrl":271,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":231,"alt":38,"copyright":38,"url":232,"id":233,"edit":234},{"width":55,"height":56},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5uG4ZbqstJ9-C8-_Valentine%27sDaygift.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z5uG4ZbqstJ9-C8-",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},"How to package Valentine’s Day gifts for shipping",[237,240,246,257,261],{"type":65,"text":238,"spans":239,"direction":68},"Packaging matters, especially when sending delicate or sentimental items. Here’s how to make your parcel as thoughtful as its contents:",[],{"type":241,"text":242,"spans":243,"direction":68},"o-list-item","Choose durable materials: Use sturdy boxes to protect your gift during transit.",[244],{"start":42,"end":245,"type":152},24,{"type":241,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":68},"Eco-friendly options: Wrap gifts in recyclable paper or biodegradable packing peanuts to show your care for the planet. We’ve got plenty of options for you to choose from. Take a look at our sustainable packaging range.",[249,251,256],{"start":42,"end":250,"type":152},20,{"start":252,"end":253,"type":192,"data":254},191,218,{"link_type":163,"url":255,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fpurchase-sustainable-packaging",{"start":252,"end":253,"type":152},{"type":241,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":68},"Personal touches: Add tissue paper, ribbons, or a handwritten note inside the parcel to make the unboxing special.",[260],{"start":42,"end":161,"type":152},{"type":65,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":68},"See our handy guide on how to wrap a parcel for more information on keeping your items protected.",[264,269],{"start":265,"end":266,"type":192,"data":267},23,43,{"link_type":163,"url":268,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel",{"start":265,"end":270,"type":152},44,{"link_type":163,"key":164,"url":165},"card$949d2dea-2f77-468c-a462-f34f462383ee",{"variation":274,"version":26,"items":275,"primary":276,"id":295,"slice_type":73,"slice_label":38},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":277,"CardText":278,"ButtonText":38,"ButtonUrl":293,"IsEco":21},"Insights for businesses: Make Valentine’s Day work for you",[279,282,287,290],{"type":65,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":68},"Valentine’s Day isn’t just about sending gifts; it’s an unmissable opportunity for business owners, hobbyists, and crafters to boost sales.",[],{"type":65,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":68},"Did you know?",[285],{"start":42,"end":286,"type":152},13,{"type":65,"text":288,"spans":289,"direction":68},"According to Statista, £1.37 billion was spent on Valentine’s Day gifts in the UK last year, with spending on jewellery seeing the highest growth. The global Valentine’s Day market was valued at $27 billion in 2023, with gifts for loved ones, friends, and even pets driving spending trends.",[],{"type":65,"text":291,"spans":292,"direction":68},"Find out how you can tap into this love-filled season:",[],{"link_type":294},"Any","card$d4964011-b505-4542-89e1-0970043757f0",{"variation":297,"version":26,"items":298,"primary":299,"id":327,"slice_type":328,"slice_label":38},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":300,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":38,"label_theme":301,"titleH2":302,"bodyText":303,"image":320,"rightImage":21,"buttonText":38,"buttonLink":325,"buttonDataGtmTrack":38,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":326,"secondary_button_external":21},"neutral","Core","1. Know what sells",[304,307,311,316],{"type":65,"text":305,"spans":306,"direction":68},"Popular Valentine’s Day products include:",[],{"type":147,"text":308,"spans":309,"direction":68},"Customised gifts: Think of engraved items, personalised photo albums, or monogrammed accessories.",[310],{"start":42,"end":161,"type":152},{"type":147,"text":312,"spans":313,"direction":68},"Gift bundles: Create curated packages, like chocolate and wine sets or self-care hampers.",[314],{"start":42,"end":315,"type":152},12,{"type":147,"text":317,"spans":318,"direction":68},"Themed items: Get your creative hat on to make the most of what you have. If you sell homemade cakes, why not bake a red velvet limited edition one? Or if your most popular items are available in red or pink, consider selling them as a Valentine’s bundle.",[319],{"start":42,"end":315,"type":152},{"dimensions":321,"alt":38,"copyright":38,"url":322,"id":323,"edit":324},{"width":55,"height":56},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5uG4JbqstJ9-C89_Jewelleryphotocopyv2.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z5uG4JbqstJ9-C89",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"link_type":294},{"link_type":294},"landing_feature_banner$2aa34902-bda8-49a6-aa39-9e6a7b386d91","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":297,"version":26,"items":330,"primary":331,"id":365,"slice_type":328,"slice_label":38},[],{"theme":332,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":38,"label_theme":301,"titleH2":333,"bodyText":334,"image":357,"rightImage":362,"buttonText":38,"buttonLink":363,"buttonDataGtmTrack":38,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":364,"secondary_button_external":21},"white","2. International sales",[335,352],{"type":65,"text":336,"spans":337,"direction":68},"According to Shopify, 20% of Valentine’s shoppers send gifts internationally. With Evri, you can deliver to over 200 countries and territories, from the USA to Hong Kong, ensuring you reach customers and loved ones worldwide.",[338,341,345,346,351],{"start":339,"end":340,"type":152},22,76,{"start":214,"end":342,"type":192,"data":343},156,{"link_type":163,"url":344,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fusa",{"start":214,"end":342,"type":152},{"start":347,"end":348,"type":192,"data":349},160,169,{"link_type":163,"url":350,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fhong-kong",{"start":347,"end":348,"type":152},{"type":65,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":68},"Tip: Promote your international shipping options early and highlight any key last posting dates for items to arrive on time.",[355],{"start":42,"end":356,"type":152},3,{"dimensions":358,"alt":38,"copyright":38,"url":359,"id":360,"edit":361},{"width":55,"height":56},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5uG3pbqstJ9-C87_Chocolates.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z5uG3pbqstJ9-C87",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},true,{"link_type":294},{"link_type":294},"landing_feature_banner$369fde50-e43c-4663-91d1-131b956c462f",{"variation":297,"version":26,"items":367,"primary":368,"id":391,"slice_type":328,"slice_label":38},[],{"theme":300,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":38,"label_theme":301,"titleH2":369,"bodyText":370,"image":383,"rightImage":21,"buttonText":38,"buttonLink":389,"buttonDataGtmTrack":38,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":390,"secondary_button_external":21},"3. Make your campaign stand out",[371,374,377,380],{"type":65,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":68},"Use creative marketing to grab the attention of your customers:",[],{"type":147,"text":375,"spans":376,"direction":68},"Add a new category on your website to signpost users to your seasonal product range.",[],{"type":147,"text":378,"spans":379,"direction":68},"Offer discounts or free Next Day UK delivery for orders over a certain amount.",[],{"type":147,"text":381,"spans":382,"direction":68},"Create a sense of urgency with countdown timers on your website and social media platforms.",[],{"dimensions":384,"alt":385,"copyright":38,"url":386,"id":387,"edit":388},{"width":55,"height":56},"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen.","valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"link_type":294},{"link_type":294},"landing_feature_banner$90ea7360-eb03-483d-83c0-6ba1a5fd383e",{"variation":297,"version":26,"items":393,"primary":394,"id":416,"slice_type":328,"slice_label":38},[],{"theme":332,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":38,"label_theme":301,"titleH2":395,"bodyText":396,"image":408,"rightImage":362,"buttonText":38,"buttonLink":414,"buttonDataGtmTrack":38,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":415,"secondary_button_external":21},"4. Save time sending parcels",[397,405],{"type":65,"text":398,"spans":399,"direction":68},"With our Bulk Send tool, you can process lots of orders at once, saving you time on booking. ",[400,404],{"start":401,"end":265,"type":192,"data":402},9,{"link_type":163,"url":403,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbulk-send",{"start":401,"end":265,"type":152},{"type":65,"text":406,"spans":407,"direction":68},"Simply link your Evri account with popular platforms like eBay, Amazon, Etsy and more or upload a CSV file. You can import online orders and manage your parcels in one place - we’ll even automatically update the tracking for you to keep your customers in the loop.",[],{"dimensions":409,"alt":38,"copyright":38,"url":410,"id":411,"edit":412},{"width":55,"height":56},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":413,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},2,{"link_type":294},{"link_type":294},"landing_feature_banner$f7a9b832-b22b-4149-b1a8-591495aff7d2",{"variation":132,"version":26,"items":418,"primary":439,"id":441,"slice_type":442,"slice_label":38},[419],{"questionTitle":420,"questionBody":421},"Got a Valentine’s Day discount code?",[422,431],{"type":65,"text":423,"spans":424,"direction":68},"If you've received a Valentine’s Day discount code through social media or email, you can use your discount code on evri.com.",[425,430],{"start":426,"end":427,"type":192,"data":428},116,124,{"link_type":163,"url":429,"target":195},"valentines-day.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002F",{"start":426,"end":427,"type":152},{"type":65,"text":432,"spans":433,"direction":68},"If you’re sending a UK or international parcel, please see our terms and conditions for usin